+O extrator PDF da W12 lia s├│ literais `(ÔÇª) Tj` / `TJ` no bytes crus. PDFs reais comprimem o content stream com `/FlateDecode`; nesse caso o DoD (ÔÇ£resuma a se├º├úo 3ÔÇØ) s├│ passava no fixture uncompressed.
